<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets call warrants on Henderson Land.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on Henderson Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Friday it is issuing 50 million American-style call warrants on Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$71.50     PREMIUM	 14 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.00	GEARING	 7.14x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.FEB.98    EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT		  HK$71.50</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
